  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "マツリカのしれんで　マツリカから\nもらえる　はなびらの　おしばな。\n７しゅるい　あつめるのが　もくてき。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "말리화의 시련에서 말리화에게\n받을 수 있는 꽃잎의 압화.\n7종류 모으는 것이 목적.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在茉莉的考驗中，\n從茉莉那裡得到的壓花花瓣。\n目標是集滿７種花瓣。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un pétale pressé qu’Oléa vous a remis lors de\nson Épreuve. Il y en a sept à collectionner.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein gepresstes Blütenblatt, das man im Rahmen von\nMatsurikas Prüfung von ihr erhält. Ziel ist es,\nsieben verschiedene Blütenblätter zu sammeln.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pétalo prensado recibido de manos de Rika durante\nsu prueba. El objetivo es reunir siete distintos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Petalo di fiore pressato ottenuto da Rika\ndurante la sua prova. L’obiettivo è ricevere\nsette petali diversi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A pressed flower petal you receive from Mina\nduring Mina’s trial. The goal is to collect seven\ndifferent kinds of petals.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "マツリカの試練で　マツリカから\nもらえる　はなびらの　押し花。\n７種類　集めるのが　目的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在茉莉的考验中，\n能从茉莉那里得到的干花花瓣。\n目标是集齐７种。",
